{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>天文台表示，預料東北季候風會在下周二（24日）抵達華南沿岸，下周三（25日）最低16°C，下周中期該區氣溫下降及有幾陣雨。而季候風會在下周後期稍為緩和，廣東沿岸天色好轉，氣溫回升。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.794280+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:18:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T13:57:36.651465+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:27.687192+00:00","content_hash":"f410f0a16415e0778ab7d2d726574f7ad1027ac08d13a440eb944fd815ffd91b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}